Summary of modifications made by luis171095 (2026):
  - YouTube stream extraction switched to the yt-dlp `android_vr` InnerTube
    client to bypass the PO-token/SABR wall and play full songs without the
    ~2 minute cut-off.
  - Audio format selection now prefers the highest-bitrate m4a (AAC-LC).
  - Search results are re-ranked to prefer individual songs over long
    compilations / mixes (`_song_rank` in `video_search`).
  - Datacenter proxy support for stream extraction from AWS IPs.
  - Added project documentation, packaging script and deployment guide.
